    {
      "id": "test-exec-footnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "Order is roughly chronological for a single task: per-phase during TDD inner loop, Step 8b at end of /jlu-execute-task, /jlu-test-suite on the dev's call before /jlu-create-pr, CI on push. Each later stage is a wider safety net than the previous.",
